This refers to your letter dated September 22, 2016 requesting for verification whether or not AAA, ____________________, including his spouse, children, relatives, and business enterprises, have filed Income Tax Returns (ITRs) covering calendar year 2010 to 2015, to wit:

a. BBB;

b. CCC;

c. DDD;

d.  EEE;

